  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut tomato into wedges. Cut zucchini into rounds.\n• Place tomato, zucchini and a drizzle of olive oil on the lined oven tray.\n• Season and toss to coat. Spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61273edb65f6093da45bcaef/step-72b7a7bc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 3-4 mins. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add garlic seasoning, water, arborio rice and vegetable stock. Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61273edb65f6093da45bcaef/step-65ecb9b9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a large baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 mins.\n• Meanwhile, cut lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61273edb65f6093da45bcaef/step-a7a31488.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir Cheddar cheese, butter and spinach leaves through risotto until spinach has wilted. Add splash of water to loosen if needed.\n• Gently stir through roast veggies. Season to taste. Divide between bowls.\n• Serve with lemon wedges. Sprinkle over chilli flakes (if using) and flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61273edb65f6093da45bcaef/step-88226958.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
